<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - March 27.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - March 27.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Consol Rutile	 163.64    0.99</p>
<p> 2   Centro Prop	    16.01    2.17</p>
<p> 3   Bk of Queen	    13.13    6.17</p>
<p> 4   MT Leyshon Gold	11.90    2.10</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	10.10    0.97</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 9.60    1.05</p>
<p> 7   Aust Tour		 9.49    0.79</p>
<p> 8   Natl Consol	     9.38    0.96</p>
<p> 9   BT Prop Trust	   9.17    1.78</p>
<p>10   Villa World	     9.01    1.11</p>
<p>11   Burswood Prop	   8.96    1.34</p>
<p>12   Ipoh			8.74    2.06</p>
<p>13   Equitilink		8.62    0.58</p>
<p>14   Indu Property	   8.60    1.00</p>
<p>15   Gandel Retail Tr	8.40    0.93</p>
